(optimize-linear)
*title Linear optimization boundary
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=0 z=0 xdt=opta-1 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *file optimize.dat time xecfc xecfcdt
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *when time=10 stop
*optimize a for xecfc=max on segment 1, trajectory 1
  fref=1000 maxitr=20 tol=1.0e-8
  par-1=50 lo-1=0 hi-1=100 ref-1=100
*end
